54"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Esta juego que se supone que es como L4D pero es mas un rogue like que otra cosa... y esta demasiado brutal", "timestamp_created": 1739586348, "timestamp_updated": 1741933823, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187824573", "author": {"steamid": "76561199538971782", "personaname": "xMisfit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199538971782/", "num_games_owned": 14, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 283, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 88, "playtime_at_review": 41, "last_played": 1787115736, "avatar": "2546b0985bf0414e50af7677c473765d619f1991"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Es buen juego, realmente me sorprendió, más que todo por las tantas malas críticas que tiene, pero siento que todas esas críticas son en base a left 4 dead 2, lo descargué solo para probarlo un poco y ya me compré hasta el pase anual para aprovechar la oferta y tener el juego completo, la verdad vale la pena, si no lo comparas con otro juego, será muy agradable y con un buen feeling a la hora de jugar la campaña y los diferentes modos que tiene:3", "timestamp_created": 1739464561, "timestamp_updated": 1739464561, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187790723", "author": {"steamid": "76561198120719294", "personaname": "KuroNox", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Mars_Ellus/", "num_games_owned": 439, "num_reviews": 109, "playtime_forever": 58, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 58, "last_played": 1739418305, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Después de jugar esto, me dieron más ganas de jugar Left 4 Dead 2.\n5/10.", "timestamp_created": 1739418667, "timestamp_updated": 1739418667, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187742605", "author": {"steamid": "76561199010727021", "personaname": "Joel_Shadic", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199010727021/", "num_games_owned": 96, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 483, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 437, "last_played": 1740442992, "avatar": "cf4e203b4c60801600171684c996e852f9afd5ea"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Meeeeee, como desperdiciaron el potencial que esto tenia\nhubiera sido mil veces mejor que hagan un L4D3 antes que esta mierda.", "timestamp_created": 1739336265, "timestamp_updated": 1740363216, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187729446", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993843186", "personaname": "Rist", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993843186/", "num_games_owned": 41, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4805, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3202, "last_played": 1754278942, "avatar": "98e9dcc1b776e51ec0f68c3a4ae69512445d0ec9"}, "language": "latam", "review": "He disfrutado mucho este juego con mis amigos. Lo obtuve en una oferta como de 95% eso sí. Tiene varios errores y se nota que el juego está abandonado por los desarrolladores, pero para lo que me costó ha valido absolutamente la pena. Creo que mucha gente ha opinado de este juego sin siquiera haberle dado una oportunidad, o con el sesgo de compararlo con un Left 4 Dead.\n\nPara mí, el sistema de cartas no es para nada complicado y es por lejos una de las cosas que más me ha enganchado al juego, por el hecho de ir consiguiendo cada vez mejores cartas y mejorando la estrategia. \nJugarlo en modo Pesadilla ha sido una experiencia muy disfrutable porque hay muchos mapas que nos cuesta mucho pasar, requiriendo de mucha coordinación del equipo, lo que lo hace estresante y a la vez emocionante.", "timestamp_created": 1739309077, "timestamp_updated": 1739309077, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "187659541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198202069687", "personaname": "sargentoDSDM™", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198202069687/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 2148, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1769, "last_played": 1739672913, "avatar": "c0eac0814b8c279587277563471ef48c61741e25"}, "language": "latam", "review": "HERMOSO", "timestamp_created": 1739223290, "timestamp_updated": 1739223290, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reaction